233: 
234: Statements P5.1-P5.6 and all the cited exact computations have been written without opening the comparison paper. A scheduled hourly checkpoint containing this file is required before the first opening of arXiv:2610.00250. Part 5.3 (comparison with both versions) is still pending that checkpoint and subsequent source access. The invariant computations above have not yet been compared to that source.
